    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know about \"small moments.\" that feels like a coping mechanism just to avoid the real truth. if you look at it objectively, all this \"connection\" is just a temporary distraction from the inevitable entropy of everything. if the net result of existence is zero, then there's no logical reason to prefer a state of being over a state of non-being. it's essentially just choosing between a +1 and a -1 when the total sum is always 0. why should one be better than the other?",
